Very curious Prof Waltert.  It would appear that your analyses did run because the Results Browser contains density estimates and so forth.  Does the Results window contain output?  I suspect it might, but you'll need to open that window to be sure.

If the Output window is also empty, check under Tools | Preferences | General to investigate the compressed format of output

The final remedy to apply is to install the software into a folder other than the default directory.  That directory path contains a space " " that sometimes causes difficulties.  Let me know what you discover.
